{"text":"Students being able to study at night. Businesses being able to stay open longer and hire more workers. Farmers being able to use mechanized tools that increase their productivity. Whole communities seeing more prosperity. In recent years, India has lifted more people out of poverty than any other country. And now we have a historic opportunity, with India leading the way to end the injustice of extreme poverty all around the world. APPLAUSE America wants to be your partner as you protect the health of your people and the beauty of this land. From the backwaters of Kerala to the banks of Gunga. As we deliver more energy, more electricity, let's do it with clean, renewable energy like solar and wind. Put cleaner vehicles on the road and more filtration systems on farms and villages.","words":[{"text":"Students","start":0.0,"end":0.84},{"text":"being","start":0.84,"end":1.1},{"text":"able","start":1.1,"end":1.32},{"text":"to","start":1.32,"end":1.48},{"text":"study","start":1.48,"end":1.68},{"text":"at","start":1.68,"end":1.84},{"text":"night","start":1.84,"end":2.04,"punct":"."},{"text":"Businesses","start":3.28,"end":3.76},{"text":"being","start":3.76,"end":3.94},{"text":"able","start":3.94,"end":4.12},{"text":"to","start":4.12,"end":4.28},{"text":"stay","start":4.28,"end":4.48},{"text":"open","start":4.48,"end":4.74},{"text":"longer","start":4.74,"end":5.08},{"text":"and","start":5.08,"end":5.22},{"text":"hire","start":5.22,"end":5.38},{"text":"more","start":5.38,"end":5.6},{"text":"workers","start":5.6,"end":6.0,"punct":"."},{"text":"Farmers","start":7.48,"end":7.48},{"text":"being","start":7.48,"end":8.18},{"text":"able","start":8.18,"end":8.44},{"text":"to","start":8.44,"end":8.58},{"text":"use","start":8.58,"end":8.82},{"text":"mechanized","start":8.82,"end":9.42},{"text":"tools","start":9.42,"end":9.66},{"text":"that","start":9.66,"end":9.88},{"text":"increase","start":9.88,"end":10.28},{"text":"their","start":10.28,"end":10.66},{"text":"productivity"